flowchart RL
    N0(Validate)
    N1([Done done])
    N2([Done])
    N3([Archive emit])
    N4{Check parse}
    N5{Check}
    N6(Load)
    N0 -->|no| N1
    N0 --> N2
    N1 --> N3
    N3 -->|fail| N4
    N2 --> N5
    N3 --> N6
    N2 --> N4
    N4 --> N5
    N1 --> N4
    N3 -->|again| N1
    N4 -->|rollback| N3
    N6 -.->|rollback| N4
